      "blurb": "Disgraced ex-C-Sec officer drinking away his pension in Chora's Den; sells what he knows.",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Harkin was a C-Sec officer until his drinking and his habits cost him the badge. He still haunts Chora's Den, still knows which officers are on the take and which gangs pay them, and will tell anyone who buys the next round. He is rude, unreliable, and usually right.</p><p>Anderson calls him a disgrace to the species, and twenty years of roughing up suspects, taking bribes and drinking on duty back that up; the human embassy covered for him until it no longer needed to. Left to fall further, he becomes \"Fade\", a Citadel racketeer who makes people disappear into the Terminus Systems for a fee and keeps Blue Suns muscle on the payroll.</p>",
