          "value": "<p><strong>Name Your Price</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span></p><hr /><p>Harkin sells what he knows. For a bribe the GM sets (often a drink and a few hundred credits), he gives up a lead: a name, a location, or what C-Sec is covering up. A successful @Check[intimidation|dc:18] check gets the same lead without paying, and earns his lasting resentment.</p>",
